name: intentfold
description: Load for ticket-based product development with the .intentfold harness, from initialization and filing through development, handoff and closure; also for multi-ticket delivery planning with cap5 or supervising one or more workers with cap6. Triggers include "intentfold", "cap1/cap2/cap3/cap3setup/cap3handoff/cap4/cap5/cap6", "开发这个工单", "准备开放开发", "开发完成，做 handoff", "建个工单", "拆单安排并行", "监督工人直到完成", and charter-directed deployment of merged code.
